  DialogueNodeData:
  - Guid: 6d139e9a-dcc1-45f7-9d19-e9ed9c266c02
    DialogueText: Please, you have to listen to me! Nobody else will believe me!
      *It* won't let them believe me.
    Position: {x: 187, y: 200}
  - Guid: 650dc299-cb60-4f79-8a06-72233177f086
    DialogueText: Crazy? I know, but I'm not! I swear! Something is controlling us.
      I don't know why, but this morning I woke up and I was in control again. Please,
      you have to believe me.
    Position: {x: 927, y: 194}
  - Guid: 3d40753c-64da-4357-8c83-93f5344c57da
    DialogueText: I know it sounds crazy, but something is controlling us. I woke
      up today in control of myself again, but everyone else is still being controlled.
      Please, you have to believe me!
    Position: {x: 928, y: 360}
  - Guid: 1281d269-c11f-48a1-8183-91f0875a904d
    DialogueText: Something is controlling us. I don't know why, but when I woke
      up this morning, I was in control again. Please, you have to believe me.
    Position: {x: 927, y: 38}
  - Guid: 94966c1d-d873-40e1-9ae3-07e55d209f90
    DialogueText: Please you have to! It's like this is all some game or something.
      Everything we say or do...
    Position: {x: 2211, y: 211}
  - Guid: 1a936d76-6a21-4823-8cea-5f178c0ff189
    DialogueText: I don't understand! It's like we're in some game or something!
      Everything we do or say...
    Position: {x: 2202, y: 390}
  - Guid: e31f0bb2-cf21-4e52-a89d-91dc0d25d9c4
    DialogueText: Oh thank god! It's like this is all a game or something. I was
      starting to think that I was the only...
    Position: {x: 2214, y: 18}
  - Guid: e1bf4905-0fd5-4661-b991-e5028e517db6
    DialogueText: Please disregard what I have previously said. I was simply joking.
      Ha. Haha. Nothing is wrong.
    Position: {x: 6566, y: 98}
  - Guid: 445d820a-059d-4bf9-8c8f-435d12a08ef0
    DialogueText: I'm... I'm sorry! Please, just let me go! I won't cause any problems!
      Agh! N-no! Get out of my head! I don't want to go back!
    Position: {x: 5434, y: 196}
  - Guid: 301c581f-4662-4457-9959-b5f6686b82b2
    DialogueText: Please! Just let us go! Agh! N-no! Get out of my head! I don't
      want to go back!
    Position: {x: 5475, y: 30}
  - Guid: ac21741c-f8d1-4609-88a8-bfb5dfaa062e
    DialogueText: Please, you have to listen to me! Nobody else will believe me!
      *It* won't let them believe me.
    Position: {x: 2973, y: 186}
  - Guid: af93f235-b8f3-472c-bb2e-e406e04328c8
    DialogueText: No, no, no. My head AGH it hurts. Please yu have to make it stop.
    Position: {x: 3929, y: 3}
  - Guid: ed6c6f38-4f65-4e43-8166-16f525b9d881
    DialogueText: Please... I'm scared...
    Position: {x: 4886, y: 161}
  - Guid: 7ce00f99-aefb-473e-9e19-97f311d6521d
    DialogueText: N-no! Get out of my head! Please, I don't want to go back!
    Position: {x: 5487, y: 371}
  - Guid: 5714187d-37b2-4742-85de-ed40f1ad5a14
    DialogueText: Y-you're sparing me? Thank you! I'll be good! I promise I won't
      cause any problems!
    Position: {x: 6570, y: 248}
